  "name": "Arctic CTD Data Collated under ESDIM Data Rescue",
  "description": "CTD: High resolution vertical profiles of conductivity, temperature, and pressure. Additional sensors may include dissolved oxygen or other biological/chemical sensors (nephelometers, flurometers).\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: To collect, record and preserve high resolution vertical profiles of conductivity, temperature, and depth (CTD).",
